{"seq":2,"slug":"promise-date-computation-model","title":"交期承诺计算模型：承诺日期、可用日期与 SLA 层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-date-computation-model","wordCount":3015,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"交期承诺计算模型-承诺日期-可用日期与-sla-层级\">交期承诺计算模型：承诺日期、可用日期与 SLA 层级</h1><p>买家在结算页看到的那一行「预计 10 月 14–17 日送达」，是一串把库存、仓库、承运商、日历和 SLA 拼起来的确定性计算，也是平台对外的公开承诺：写错它，轻则物流投诉暴涨，重则触发按时送达率考核并影响搜索排序。本文只讲这一层——承诺日期如何从「货在哪、什么时候能发、路上要几天」推出来，以及同一批库存为什么必须按客户等级给出不同口径。本章目录见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺日期的三段分解\">核心概念：承诺日期的三段分解</h2><p>承诺日期不是「今天 + 一个拍脑袋的天数」，而是三段可分别校验、分别监控、分别取数据的区间之和（三段算完还要按订单优先级决定谁先占用库存，见同章 <a href=\"promise-allocation-priority-policy\">承诺分配与优先级策略</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>promised date</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>availability date</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>handling time</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>transit time</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{promised date} = \\text{availability date} + \\text{handling time} + \\text{transit time}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">promised date</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">availability date</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">handling time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transit time</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>可用日期（availability date）</strong>：该仓最早能把这件商品<strong>分配给这张订单</strong>的时刻。由库存水位、补货在途（inbound PO）、其他订单占用和分配策略决定，是三个变量里唯一真正「算出来」的部分。上一章的跨仓 ATP 分池回答的正是「这件货此刻算不算数」，本文在它的输出之上继续往前走。</li>\n<li><strong>处理时间（handling time）</strong>：从分配成功到交给承运商的仓库作业时间，含拣货、打包、出库交接，由仓库作业能力与**当日发货截单时间（cut-off time）**决定。</li>\n<li><strong>运输时间（transit time）</strong>：从揽收入网到妥投的天数，由承运商服务层级、干线路径与目的地共同决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中两个变量<strong>日历相关</strong>：仓库截单时间以<strong>仓库本地时区</strong>为准，承运商分拣与派送以<strong>目的地本地日历</strong>为准，买家看到的日期以<strong>买家本地日期</strong>呈现。一个从美国仓发往德国的包裹，至少要穿过三个时区口径和两套节假日日历。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[订单行请求&lt;br/&gt;SKU + 数量 + 收货地] --&gt; B{ATP 分池&lt;br/&gt;哪个仓有货?}&#10;    B --&gt;|无仓可满足| C[承诺不可行&lt;br/&gt;返回缺货或最长交期]&#10;    B --&gt;|命中候选仓列表| D[计算各仓可用日期&lt;br/&gt;库存 + 在途 + 分配]&#10;    D --&gt; E[叠加处理时间&lt;br/&gt;受当日截单时间约束]&#10;    E --&gt; F[叠加运输时间&lt;br/&gt;按服务层级 + 目的地]&#10;    F --&gt; G{多仓候选&lt;br/&gt;取最早?}&#10;    G --&gt;|成本可接受| H[选最早可达仓&lt;br/&gt;拆单或整单]&#10;    G --&gt;|成本超阈| I[选就近低本仓&lt;br/&gt;承诺稍晚的日期]&#10;    H --&gt; J[按客户 SLA 层级&lt;br/&gt;调整承诺区间]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[返回承诺日期 + 可信度区间]\">graph TD\n    A[订单行请求&lt;br/&gt;SKU + 数量 + 收货地] --&gt; B{ATP 分池&lt;br/&gt;哪个仓有货?}\n    B --&gt;|无仓可满足| C[承诺不可行&lt;br/&gt;返回缺货或最长交期]\n    B --&gt;|命中候选仓列表| D[计算各仓可用日期&lt;br/&gt;库存 + 在途 + 分配]\n    D --&gt; E[叠加处理时间&lt;br/&gt;受当日截单时间约束]\n    E --&gt; F[叠加运输时间&lt;br/&gt;按服务层级 + 目的地]\n    F --&gt; G{多仓候选&lt;br/&gt;取最早?}\n    G --&gt;|成本可接受| H[选最早可达仓&lt;br/&gt;拆单或整单]\n    G --&gt;|成本超阈| I[选就近低本仓&lt;br/&gt;承诺稍晚的日期]\n    H --&gt; J[按客户 SLA 层级&lt;br/&gt;调整承诺区间]\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[返回承诺日期 + 可信度区间]</pre><p>上图有两个决策点：<strong>取最早仓还是取低成本仓</strong>——纯按最早可达承诺会系统性把订单推向远仓、空运和昂贵拆单，生产系统通常设成本上浮阈值，超出就接受更晚的日期；<strong>按 SLA 层级调整</strong>——同一批库存、同一收货地址，金牌会员可能看到更早的日期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可用日期-把库存水位翻译成日期\">可用日期：把库存水位翻译成日期</h2><p>可用日期是唯一需要真正求解的量。它的输入是上一章 ATP 分池的结果，输出是「第 D 天这件商品可用于这张订单」。<strong>水位差分法</strong>：给定当前可用量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与未来每日补货到仓计划 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 天判断能否满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>d</mi></munderover><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_d = A_0 + \\sum_{i=1}^{d} R_i - \\sum_{i=1}^{d} D_i \\geq q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是已承诺给其他订单的占用量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是本单需求量；最小满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_d \\geq q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 就是可用日期。此法适合单仓、需求平稳、补货计划可信的场景；缺点是假设所有已承诺订单都在同一窗口兑现，一旦有订单推迟或取消，水位就偏保守。</p>\n<p><strong>订单级模拟（order-level pegging）</strong>：把未满足订单与未来补货批次排成队列，按优先级逐一「挂账（pegging）」到具体库存批次，本单挂到哪个批次，可用日期就是它的到货日。SAP IBP 的 supply assignment / aATP 与 Kinaxis 的 concurrent planning 走的都是这条路，因为它能同时处理优先级、替代料、拆单和批次约束。代价是计算量随订单数增长，需靠增量重排控制延迟。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>水位差分法</th>\n<th>订单级模拟（pegging）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算代价</td>\n<td>低，可按仓按天聚合</td>\n<td>高，需维护订单批次队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否处理优先级</td>\n<td>只能通过预留额度间接表达</td>\n<td>原生支持，逐单挂账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补货延迟的影响</td>\n<td>全局推迟，误差被放大</td>\n<td>只影响挂到该批次的订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代料 / 拆单</td>\n<td>难以表达</td>\n<td>可表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>单仓、SKU 少、波动小</td>\n<td>多仓、多批次、有优先级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪种方法，<strong>在途库存的可承诺性必须有条件</strong>：在途货何时能承诺，取决于它是否已绑定承运商、是否有确定的到仓日期、以及历史到仓准时率。成熟做法是给每个在途批次一个<strong>可信度因子</strong>——只有当到仓准时率的置信下界高于阈值时才计入可用日期，否则计入一个更晚的保守日期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处理时间与截单-temporal-cut-off-的双口径\">处理时间与截单：temporal cut-off 的双口径</h2><p>处理时间不是常量，它由仓库的**截单时间（cut-off time）**切分。规则朴素却极易写错：订单在仓库本地时间 14:00 前确认则当日处理、次日交承运商，14:00 后顺延一天。这条规则一旦和时区、周末、节假日、仓库临时停工叠加，就会产生大量边界缺陷。</p>\n<p>第一类缺陷是<strong>时区混用</strong>。买家在东京凌晨 1 点下单，此时美国西部仓还是前一天上午 10 点，订单赶得上当日截单；若系统统一按 UTC 判断截单，这笔订单会被错误推迟一整天。正确做法是引擎内部<strong>统一用仓库本地时区判定截单</strong>，只在最终呈现时转回买家本地日期。</p>\n<p>第二类缺陷是<strong>把截单时间当营业时间</strong>——它是「当日发货的最晚确认时刻」，可能早于仓库下班（要留出拣货打包窗口），也可能晚于（夜班仓），必须是按仓库、按星期几、按季节可配置的字段。</p>\n<p>第三类缺陷是<strong>节假日只算一方</strong>：发货地日历决定仓库是否作业，目的地承运商日历决定派送是否发生——美国仓在感恩节停作业，德国目的地在 10 月 3 日统一日停派送。两套日历都得接入，任一段遇非工作日即顺延：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>nextBusinessDay</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>warehouseCalendar</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>cutoff</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{ship}} = \\text{nextBusinessDay}(d_{\\text{order}}, \\text{warehouseCalendar}, \\text{cutoff})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nextBusinessDay</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">warehouseCalendar</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cutoff</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promised</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>addBusinessDays</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>carrierCalendar</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{promised}} = \\text{addBusinessDays}(d_{\\text{ship}}, T, \\text{carrierCalendar})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promised</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">addBusinessDays</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">carrierCalendar</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是运输天数，两个函数必须可注入日历数据——节假日每年变化，硬编码会逐年腐坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运输时间-服务层级-区域模型与实际承运日历\">运输时间：服务层级、区域模型与实际承运日历</h2><p>运输时间有三种数据来源，精度与成本递增。<strong>区域模型（zone-based lane model）</strong> 把目的地按邮编或国家划为若干区域，为每个「发货仓 × 区域 × 服务层级」组合维护静态天数表，例如「美西仓 → 德国 DE-1 区 → 标准快递 = 6 天」，读取极快，适合高并发结算页。<strong>承运商实时报价 API</strong> 在给出运费的同时返回预计送达日，日期已内含其自身服务日历，但每次调用都有网络往返与费率，需<strong>预计算 + 缓存</strong>并用区域模型兜底。<strong>历史承运数据回归</strong> 最能反映真实表现：用过去 N 天同 lane 的实际妥投天数分布取分位数而非均值——用 P50 还是 P95 作为承诺天数，直接决定按时送达达标率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多仓候选与拆单-承诺日期的组合优化\">多仓候选与拆单：承诺日期的组合优化</h2><p>当一个 SKU 在多个仓都有货时，承诺计算就从「求一个日期」变成「在候选方案中选一个」：单仓整发、跨仓拆单、替代 SKU 组合。拆单能缩短整体承诺日期（每件从最近的仓发），但带来额外运费和多次收货体验。对候选方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，整单承诺日期是所有子包裹承诺日期的最大值——买家只有在最后一个包裹到齐时才算「订单完成」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>parcels</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>s</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_s = \\max_{p \\in \\text{parcels}(s)} d_p, \\qquad \\min_s \\; d_s \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\text{cost}(s) \\leq \\text{cost}_{\\text{base}} \\times (1 + \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parcels</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是平台愿意为缩短交期付出的成本上浮比例：大促期间可调大到 0.5 换取交付时效，日常收紧到 0.1 控制履约成本。需要注意<strong>局部最优不等于全局最优</strong>：逐单把订单推向最早可达仓，会在库存紧张时耗尽稀缺的近距离库存，导致后续订单只能接受更晚的日期。生产系统通常引入一层<strong>库存保护（reservation / buffer）</strong>，给高价值客户或高毛利订单预留一部分近距离库存额度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sla-层级-同一库存的不同承诺口径\">SLA 层级：同一库存的不同承诺口径</h2><p>承诺日期的最后一个自由度是<strong>给谁承诺</strong>。同一批库存、同一收货地址，不同客户等级看到的日期可能不同，背后是三个可调维度：承运层级、仓源优先级、承诺分位数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SLA 层级</th>\n<th>承运层级</th>\n<th>仓源优先级</th>\n<th>承诺分位数</th>\n<th>典型承诺</th>\n<th>违约后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准 Standard</td>\n<td>经济型陆运/海运</td>\n<td>就近低本仓</td>\n<td>P75</td>\n<td>7–10 天</td>\n<td>无赔付，仅体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加急 Expedited</td>\n<td>标准空运</td>\n<td>最早可达仓</td>\n<td>P90</td>\n<td>3–5 天</td>\n<td>部分运费返还</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先 Priority</td>\n<td>优先空运</td>\n<td>最早可达仓 + 预留额度</td>\n<td>P95</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>运费全额返还</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会员保证 Guaranteed</td>\n<td>指定承运 + 时效保证</td>\n<td>专用库存池</td>\n<td>P98</td>\n<td>明确到日</td>\n<td>现金赔付 + 考核扣分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>承诺分位数</strong>是最不直观、也最关键的一列。若承诺日期取运输时间均值（P50），意味着一半订单会晚于承诺，按时送达率封顶在 50%；要做到 95% 达标，至少要用 P95 的运输天数算承诺。这就是为什么平台的实际承诺往往比「理论上最快」保守 1–2 天。</p>\n<p><strong>平台侧的硬约束</strong>会反过来塑造这些层级。Amazon 对卖家自配送订单有按时送达率（on-time delivery rate）考核，未达标影响账户健康，且对卖家自设的「处理时间 + 运输时间」承诺有明确可靠性要求。承诺引擎的输出因此不能只追求「看起来快」，而要在达标率与转化率之间取平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>跨时区的呈现</strong>是最后一层收尾：引擎内部用两个绝对时刻锚定承诺（发货日按发货地日历、送达日按目的地日历），展示时统一转到买家本地日期，并在跨月、跨年、夏令时切换的边界上显式校验。美国与欧盟夏令时切换日期不同，某些年份存在两三周错位窗口，那段时间按固定 UTC 偏移换算会整体错一天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺日期可分解为 <code>可用日期 + 处理时间 + 运输时间</code>，三段分别取数、分别监控、分别可校验。</li>\n<li>可用日期是唯一真正求解的量：水位差分法适合单仓简单场景，订单级 pegging 适合多仓多批次与有优先级的场景；在途库存必须带可信度因子。</li>\n<li>截单时间按<strong>仓库本地时区</strong>判定；处理与派送各自读自己那套日历（发货地作业日历 + 目的地承运日历），节假日数据必须可注入而非硬编码。</li>\n<li>运输时间有三层来源：区域模型表（快、粗）、承运商实时 API（准、贵）、历史妥投回归（真实、需离线训练），生产系统分层使用。</li>\n<li>多仓下承诺是带成本约束的组合优化，选最早仓与控成本存在张力，需要库存保护避免短期博弈耗尽近距离库存。</li>\n<li>SLA 层级通过承运层级、仓源优先级和<strong>承诺分位数</strong>区分客户；分位数直接决定达标率，也受平台账号考核硬约束。</li>\n<li>跨时区呈现要做夏令时与节假日边界的显式校验——这是跨境承诺最高频的线上缺陷来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交期承诺计算模型：承诺日期、可用日期与 SLA 层级","id":"交期承诺计算模型-承诺日期-可用日期与-sla-层级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺日期的三段分解","id":"核心概念-承诺日期的三段分解"},{"level":2,"text":"可用日期：把库存水位翻译成日期","id":"可用日期-把库存水位翻译成日期"},{"level":2,"text":"处理时间与截单：temporal cut-off 的双口径","id":"处理时间与截单-temporal-cut-off-的双口径"},{"level":2,"text":"运输时间：服务层级、区域模型与实际承运日历","id":"运输时间-服务层级-区域模型与实际承运日历"},{"level":2,"text":"多仓候选与拆单：承诺日期的组合优化","id":"多仓候选与拆单-承诺日期的组合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA 层级：同一库存的不同承诺口径","id":"sla-层级-同一库存的不同承诺口径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ATP 与 CTP 的定义、承诺语义与边界划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/atp-ctp-definition-boundaries"},"next":{"title":"可承诺量分配与优先级策略（客户分层、渠道权重与抢占）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-allocation-priority-policy"}}